# Licensing & Legal Notice
## PixelActive CityScape 1.8 — Open-Source Preservation Project

This repository operates under a dual-tier licensing and digital preservation framework to balance open-source freedom with respect for historical intellectual property:

---

### Part 1: Open Source Preservation License (MIT License)

**Applies to**:
- All decompiled, syntax-repaired, and modernized C# source code (`src/palDotNet/`, `src/edEditorDotNet/`, `src/ktKitDotNet/`, `src/gisImageryDotNet/`, `src/BugReporter/`).
- All reverse engineering tools, format parsers (`tools/csp_reader.py`, `tools/parc_tool.py`), test suites (`tests/test_suite.py`), build automation scripts (`build.ps1`, `package.ps1`), launchers, and documentation.

